  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n September 1, 2026 Lisbon-Mt. Vernon Area EMS District Special Election | Johnson County\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n \n \n Skip to main content\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n Meetings and Agendas\n \n \n\n County News\n \n \n\n Event Calendar\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n I Need To\n \n \n\n Apply for a grant or submit a bid\n \n \n\n Find County contact information\n \n \n\n Fill out a form\n \n \n\n Find a job\n \n \n\n Get a free gun lock\n \n \n\n Get a permit\n \n \n\n Pay court fines\n \n \n\n Pay taxes or fees\n \n \n\n Register a vehicle\n \n \n\n Renew my driver's license\n \n \n\n Request public records\n \n \n\n Serve jury duty\n \n \n \n \n \n\n County Groups\n \n \n\n Department Directory & Resources\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\nSearch\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nSeptember 1, 2026 Lisbon-Mt. Vernon Area EMS District Special Election\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\n Home\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\nResults (Johnson County only)\nYes 19\nNo 1\nBoard of Trustees\n\nBobbi Kruse 6\nKimberly Tucker 2\nLori Lynch 2\nRandy Brannaman 1\nSample Ballot\n60% Required. \nShall the following public measure be adopted? \nThe Lisbon-Mt. Vernon Area EMS District has been created to fund emergency medical services within the District, to be provided by Lisbon-Mt. Vernon Ambulance, and in order to pay the costs of this service it is necessary to levy an initial tax of $0.667 cents per $1,000 (One Thousand Dollars) with a maximum levy of $1.00 dollars per $1,000 (One Thousand Dollars) of assessed value on all the taxable property (not including agricultural land or centrally assessed property) within the district. If you approve the levy of this tax, vote yes and if you disapprove of this tax, vote no. \nWrite in up to three (3) candidates to serve as trustee(s) for the Lisbon-Mt. Vernon Area EMS District.\nJohnson County voters in Cedar Township northeast of the Cedar River are eligible to vote in this election. Map\nMonday, August 17: Deadline to request mailed ballots. Forms must be in our office by 5 p.m. In person early voting will still be available after this date. \nMonday, August 17: Voter pre-registration deadline, 5 p.m. Voter registration is still available after this date using the election day registration procedure. \nMonday, August 31: Last day for in person early voting at the Auditor's Office. \nTuesday, September 1: Election Day. Polls open at the Johnson County Conservation Sutliff Shop, 5438 Sutliff Rd. NE, from noon to 8 p.m.\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\nNeed to talk to someone from the county?\n\n\nContact Us \n\n \n\n\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n Title VI and ADA Resources\n \n \n\n About Johnson County\n \n \n\n Contact\n \n \n\n Email subscriptions\n \n \n\n American Rescue Plan Act\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n